    "title": "Sheetz Food Delivery & Rewards",
    "description": "Whether you\u2019re a Sheetz Fan, Friend or Freak we\u2019ve improved the app to make your Sheetz Run better than ever! \r\n\r\nWith a fresh new look, it\u2019s like it came straight out of our Made-To-Order kitchen! Go ahead. Order the mozz sticks on your burger. Why the Sheetz Not?\r\n\r\n1.\tSave time by ordering and paying ahead for your favorite MTO foods and specialty drinks.\r\n2.\tSave money by receiving exclusive app only offers!\r\n3.\tReorder your favorites in seconds.\r\n4.\tCustomize your rewardz to get those Mozzarella Sticks you\u2019ve been eyeing up!\r\n5.\tUse SheetzPay to make purchases with your phone inside any of our stores.\r\n6. Unlock special features only available in stores, like using SheetzGO! to scan and checkout on your phone!\r\n7. Show some love by sending a digital gift card to a Sheetz Freak in your life!",
